title: "Cyber Policy Benchmark"
message: >-
  Please cite this project when using its code, original evaluation questions,
  audit methodology, or teaching materials. Also cite the original standards,
  research, software, and models actually used; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
  the bibliographies in doc/. Record the exact release or commit and artifact
  hashes in your methods. No paper or release DOI is asserted by this file.
