abstract: >-
  A cybersecurity policy and compliance evaluation project with historical
  context-condition experiments, a provenance-aware export audit, and an
  opt-in paired contemporary comparison and classroom-review protocol.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - compliance
  - language-model evaluation
  - reproducibility
  - cybersecurity education
